<title>ITALY: Gustavo Visentini named new Banco Sicilia chairman.</title>
<headline>Gustavo Visentini named new Banco Sicilia chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Banco di Sicilia on Wednesday elected Gustavo Visentini as the southern Italian bank's new chairman.</p>
<p>Visentini, head of the Italian mutual funds association Assogestioni, replaces Berardino Libonati whose term of office has expired.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
